        Japan's Digital Nomad Visa allows remote workers from 49 qualifying treaty nations to reside in Japan for up to six months. Eligible applicants must prove an annual income exceeding ¥10 million (~$68,000 USD), hold comprehensive private medical insurance with ¥10M+ coverage, and are exempt from Japanese local income taxation under bilateral tax treaty provisions.
